@base = http://localhost:5113
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@carla = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

# Named requests (# @name) let you reuse the saga identifier returned by POST /transfers
# (VS Code REST Client, Visual Studio 17.12+, Rider).

### Participants' accounts: Alice 50,000 €, Bob 500 €, Carla 1,000 $
GET {{base}}/accounts

### ─── Nominal run ───

### Transfer Alice → Bob: 202, the saga runs in the background
# @name transfer
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 250 }

### Track the saga: state of each step + log
GET {{base}}/sagas/{{transfer.response.body.sagaId}}

### All the sagas
GET {{base}}/sagas

### Notifications sent (step ⑥)
GET {{base}}/notifications

### ─── Transient failure: 2 exchange failures, then success ───
PUT {{base}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exchangeFailuresLeft": 2 }

###
# @name transient
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{carla}}", "amount": 100 }

### Log: "attempt 1/4", "attempt 2/4", then ✔ ConvertCurrencies
GET {{base}}/sagas/{{transient.response.body.sagaId}}

### ─── Lasting failure: give up at the 4th failure, compensation in reverse order ───
PUT {{base}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exchangeDown": true }

###
# @name lasting
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{carla}}", "amount": 100 }

### Status Cancelled, ReserveFunds undone (funds released)
GET {{base}}/sagas/{{lasting.response.body.sagaId}}

### Put the exchange back in service
PUT {{base}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exchangeDown": false }

### ─── Waiting for an analyst: transfer ≥ 10,000 € ───
# @name large
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 12000 }

### Status Waiting (deadline: 60 s, after which the saga is compensated)
GET {{base}}/sagas/{{large.response.body.sagaId}}

### The analyst's decision (approved: false → compensation)
POST {{base}}/sagas/{{large.response.body.sagaId}}/compliance
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approved": true, "comment": "supporting documents received" }

### ─── Point of no return: after the final debit, no more compensation ───
PUT {{base}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notificationsDown": true }

###
# @name pivot
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 50 }

### Status ManualInterventionRequired: the money is transferred, the notification failed
GET {{base}}/sagas/{{pivot.response.body.sagaId}}

###
PUT {{base}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notificationsDown": false }

### ─── Resumption: stop the orchestrator, start a transfer, restart ───
POST {{base}}/admin/orchestrator/stop

###
# @name resumption
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 75 }

### Still Running: nothing moves
GET {{base}}/sagas/{{resumption.response.body.sagaId}}

### Restart: the saga resumes where it was
POST {{base}}/admin/orchestrator/restart
